0.030 mmol) and 3 mL of anhydrous dichloromethane. Methyl
3-tert-butyldimethylsilanyloxy-2-diazobut-3-enoate (564 mg, 2.20 mmol)
was then added dropwise over 5 min via a 1-mL syringe. Finally,
