$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Representative Procedure for the Catalytic
Asymmetric Vinylogous Mukaiyama Aldol Addition: Preparation of
(E)-(S)-7-(tert-butyl-diphenyl-silanyloxy)-
5-hydroxy-2-methyl-hept-2-enethioic acid S-tert-butyl ester SI10. The
crude reaction mixture was obtained by following the general procedure
for the catalytic asymmetric vinylogous Mukaiyama aldol addition using
aldehyde SI9 (233 mg, 0.745 mmol, 1.00 eq) as starting material and was
purified by flash chromatography using a 2.5 × 18 cm silica gel column
eluting with a solvent mixture of 5% acetone/hexanes (600 mL). The eluant
was collected in 30 mL portions and the product containing fractions (7
to 12) were combined and concentrated to give alcohol SI10 (349 mg, 0.720
mmol, 97%.) as a clear colorless oil. The ratio of enantiomers was
determined to be er = 96 : 4 (with BF3•EtO2 as Lewis-acid, er = 54 :46)
by HPLC analysis using a Daicel Chiralcel OD-H silica column, eluting
with a mobile phase of 15% 2-propanol/hexanes and a flow rate of 0.5
mL/min, which gave the retention times for the major and minor
enantiomers of 7.3 and 8.9 min, respectively, detecting with a Rainin
Dynamax Refractive Index Detector Model RI-1: Rf 0.56 (20%
acetone/hexanes); [α]D 20 -1.4 (c = 1.045, CHCl3); 500 MHz 1H NMR (CDCl3)
δ 7.76 – 7.74 (m, 4H), 7.48 – 7.39 (m, 6H), 6.75 (ddq, J = 7.3, 7.3, 1.3
Hz, 1H), 4.08 (dddd, J = 9.0, 6.4, 6.4, 3.0 Hz, 1H), 3.93 – 3.85 (m, 2H),
3.45 (bs, 1H), 2.45 (ddd, J = 15.0, 6.9, 6.9 Hz, 1H), 2.37 (ddd, J =
13.7, 6.4, 6.4 Hz, 1H), 1.85 (s, 3H), 1.81 – 1.73(m, 1H), 1.71 – 1.66 (m,
1H), 1.50 (s, 9H), 1.08 (s, 9H); 125 MHz 13C NMR (CDCl3) δ 195.0, 138.8,
135.8 (2), 135.7 (2), 135.0, 133.1, 133.0, 130.1 (2), 129.8, 128.1 (2),
127.9, 71.3, 63.6, 47.6, 38.1, 36.9, 30.1 (3), 27.0 (3), 19.2, 12.8; 125
MHz DEPT (CDCl3) δ CH3: 30.1 (3), 27.0 (3), 12.7. CH2: 63.6, 38.0, 36.8.
CH: 135.7 (2), 135.7 (2), 135.0, 130.1 (2), 129.8, 128.0 (2), 127.9,
71.3. C: 195.0, 138.8, 133.1, 133.0, 47.6, 19.2; IR (neat) 3500 (bs),
3071, 2959, 2934, 2858, 1965, 1893, 1817, 1725, 1651, 1591, 1472, 1427,
1390, 1363, 1333, 1309, 1259, 1217, 1186, 1161, 1110, 1082, 1025, 1007,
937, 893, 859, 823 cm-1; HRMS (CI) Calcd for C28H41O3SSi m/z (M+H):
485.2546. Found: 428.2548. LRMS (CI) Calcd for C24H31O3SSi m/z (M-tBu):
427.2. Found: 427.2.
