$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 3.2. Diastereoselective Mukaiyama aldol
reaction of cyclohexanones with acyclic ketene acetals Ethyl
(1-(tert-butyldimethylsilyloxy)cyclohexyl)acetate (4a) Ethyl
((1S*,2R*)-2-benzyl-1-(tert-butyldimethylsilyloxy)cyclohexyl)acetate (4d)
According to the synthetic procedure for 4a, this compound was obtained
in 96% yield (374.7 mg, 0.96 mmol) by the reaction of
2-benzylcyclohexanone 2f (184 μL, 1.0 mmol) with
tert-butyl(1-ethoxyvinyloxy)dimethylsilane (303.7 mg, 1.5 mmol) in CH2Cl2
(2.0 mL) in the presence of Tf2CHCH2CHTf2 1 (0.29 mg, 0.5 μmol) for 2.5 h
at -178 °C. Colorless crystals (Recrystallized from EtOAc);. Mp.
59.4-61.5 °C; IR (neat) ν 3027, 2934, 2856, 1731, 1033, 835, 769 cm-1; 1H
NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 0.15 (3H, s), 0.16 (3H, s), 0.97 (9H, s),
0.98-1.08 (1H, m), 1.24-1.33 (2H, m), 1.30 (3H, t, J = 7.1 Hz), 1.41-1.50
(1H, m), 1.51-1.83 (5H, m), 2.32 (1H, dd, J = 13.1, 11.1 Hz), 2.48 (1H,
d, J = 13.0 Hz), 3.02 (1H, d, J = 13.0 Hz), 3.13 (1H, dd, J = 13.1, 3.1
Hz), 4.11-4.26 (2H, m), 7.12-7.20 (3H, m), 7.22-7.29 (2H, m); 13C NMR
(100 MHz, CDCl3) δ -12.1 and -11.7, 14.3, 18.8, 21.7, 25.6, 26.1, 26.2,
36.2, 38.1, 45.6, 46.4, 60.4, 76.4, 125.4, 128.0, 129.4, 141.7, 170.7; MS
(ESI-TOF) m/z 413 [M+Na]+; HRMS calcd for C23H38NaO3Si [M+Na]+, 413.2488;
found, 413.2464. Anal. Calcd for C23H38O3Si: C, 70.72; H, 9.81. Found: C,
70.92; H, 9.77.
